      {
        "t": "mistake",
        "html": "Assuming <b>re-</b> always means “again.” In <i>reticent</i>, <i>reclusive</i> and <i>relinquish</i> it means back or away: a reclusive person shuts themselves away, not again. And <b>de-</b> can mean “completely”: to <i>devastate</i> is to lay waste completely."
